msgid "Show Introduction Page"
msgstr "परिचय पेज देखाव"

#: generalopts.cpp:86
#| msgid "Home &URL:"
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Show My Home Page"
msgstr "मोर मुख पेज ल देखाव"

#: generalopts.cpp:87
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Show Blank Page"
msgstr "खाली पेज देखाव"

#: generalopts.cpp:88
#| msgid "Boo&kmarks"
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Show My Bookmarks"
msgstr "मोर निसानी ल देखाव"

#: generalopts.cpp:97
#| msgid "Home &URL:"
msgid "Home page:"
msgstr "मुख पेज:"

#: generalopts.cpp:102
#| msgid "Select Home Folder"
msgid "Select Home Page"
msgstr "होम पेज चुनव"

#: generalopts.cpp:109
#| msgid ""
#| "This is the URL (e.g. a folder or a web page) where Konqueror will jump "
#| "to when the \"Home\" button is pressed. This is usually your home folder, "
#| "symbolized by a 'tilde' (~)."
msgid ""
"This is the URL of the web page where Konqueror (as web browser) will jump "
"to when the \"Home\" button is pressed. When Konqueror is started as a file "
"manager, that button makes it jump to your local home folder instead."
msgstr ""
"वेब पेज के ये वो यूआरएल हे जहां कान्करर सीधे जाही जब \"घर\" बटन "
"ल दबाय जाही. जब कान्करर ल फाइल प्रबंधक के रूप मं चालू करे जाथे तब ओ बटन आपके घर फोल्डर मं ले "
"जाथे."

#: htmlopts.cpp:49
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Browser</h1> Here you can configure Konqueror's browser "
"functionality. Please note that the file manager functionality has to be "
"configured using the \"File Manager\" configuration module. You can make "
"some settings how Konqueror should handle the HTML code in the web pages it "
"loads. It is usually not necessary to change anything here."
msgstr ""

#: htmlopts.cpp:57
msgid "Boo&kmarks"
msgstr "निसानी (&k)"

#: htmlopts.cpp:62
msgid "Ask for name and folder when adding bookmarks"
msgstr "जब पसंद जोड़े जाही तहां नाम अउ फोल्डर बर पूछव"

#: htmlopts.cpp:65
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will allow you to change the title of the "
"bookmark and choose a folder in which to store it when you add a new "
"bookmark."
msgstr ""

#: htmlopts.cpp:71
msgid "Show only marked bookmarks in bookmark toolbar"
msgstr "सिरिफ चिनहित पसंद ल पसंद औजार पट्टी मं देखाव"

#: htmlopts.cpp:73
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will show only those bookmarks in the "
"bookmark toolbar which you have marked to do so in the bookmark editor."
msgstr ""

#: htmlopts.cpp:82
msgid "Form Com&pletion"
msgstr "फारम भरना (&p)"

#: htmlopts.cpp:87
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will remember the data you enter in web "
"forms and suggest it in similar fields for all forms."
msgstr ""
"यदि ए डब्बा चुने जाथे , जऊन डाटा आप मन वेब फारम मं भरथो कान्करर ओ मन ल याद रखथे  अउ "
"सब्बो फारम के अइसने फील्ड मं ए मन ल सुझाव के रूप मं प्रस्तुत करथे ."

#: htmlopts.cpp:92
msgid "&Maximum completions:"
msgstr "सबसे अधिक कतका भरव : (&M)"

#: htmlopts.cpp:96
msgid "Here you can select how many values Konqueror will remember for a form field."
msgstr "इहां आप मन चुने सकथो कि फारम फील्ड बर कान्करर कतका मूल्य याद रखही."

#: htmlopts.cpp:104
msgid "Mouse Beha&vior"
msgstr "मुसुवा बरताव (&v)"

#: htmlopts.cpp:108
msgid "Chan&ge cursor over links"
msgstr "संकली के ऊपर संकेतक बदलव (&g)"

#: htmlopts.cpp:110
msgid ""
"If this option is set, the shape of the cursor will change (usually to a "
"hand) if it is moved over a hyperlink."
msgstr ""
"यदि ए विकल्प सेट होथे , संकेतक के रूप (प्रायः हथेली के रूप में) बदल जाथे  जब "
"वह कोनो हायपर संकली के ऊपर ले जाय जाथे."

#: htmlopts.cpp:114
msgid "M&iddle click opens URL in selection"
msgstr "बीच किलिक करे से चुने गे यूआरएल ल खोलथे (&i)"

#: htmlopts.cpp:117
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, you can open the URL in the selection by middle "
"clicking on a Konqueror view."
msgstr ""
"यदि ए डब्बा चुने जाथे, आप मन चुने गे यूआरएल ल मध्य किलिक कर कान्करर दृस्य मं खोल "
"सकथो ."

#: htmlopts.cpp:121
msgid "Right click goes &back in history"
msgstr "जेवनी किलिक से इतिहास मं पीछू जाव. (&b)"

#: htmlopts.cpp:124
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, you can go back in history by right clicking on a "
"Konqueror view. To access the context menu, press the right mouse button and "
"move."
msgstr ""

#: htmlopts.cpp:132
msgid "Images"
msgstr "फोटू"

#: htmlopts.cpp:136
msgid "A&utomatically load images"
msgstr "फोटू अपने अपन लोड करव (&u)"

#: htmlopts.cpp:137
msgid ""
"<html>If this box is checked, Konqueror will automatically load any images "
"that are embedded in a web page. Otherwise, it will display placeholders for "
"the images, and you can then manually load the images by clicking on the "
"image button.<br />Unless you have a very slow network connection, you will "
"probably want to check this box to enhance your browsing experience.</html>"
msgstr ""

#: htmlopts.cpp:147
msgid "Dra&w frame around not completely loaded images"
msgstr "पूरा लोड नइ होय फोटू मन के चारों तरफ एक फ्रेम बनाव (&w)"

#: htmlopts.cpp:148
msgid ""
"<html>If this box is checked, Konqueror will draw a frame as a placeholder "
"around images embedded in a web page that are not yet fully loaded.<br />You "
"will probably want to check this box to enhance your browsing experience, "
"especially if have a slow network connection.</html>"
msgstr ""

#: htmlopts.cpp:159
msgctxt "animations"
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "सक्छम"

#: htmlopts.cpp:160
msgctxt "animations"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "अक्छम"

#: htmlopts.cpp:161
msgid "Show Only Once"
msgstr "सिरिफ एक बार देखाव"

#: htmlopts.cpp:162
msgid ""
"<html>Controls how Konqueror shows animated images:<br /><ul><li><b>Enabled</"
"b>: Show all animations completely.</li><li><b>Disabled</b>: Never show "
"animations, show the starting image only.</li><li><b>Show only once</b>: "
"Show all animations completely but do not repeat them.</li></ul></html>"
msgstr ""

#: htmlopts.cpp:167
msgid "A&nimations:"
msgstr "एनिमेसन्सः (&n)"

#: htmlopts.cpp:174
msgid "Allow automatic delayed &reloading/redirecting"
msgstr "विलम्बित रिलोडिंग/रिडायरेक्टिंग अपने अपन करे देव (&r)"

#: htmlopts.cpp:175
msgid ""
"Some web pages request an automatic reload or redirection after a certain "
"period of time. By unchecking this box Konqueror will ignore these requests."
msgstr ""

#: htmlopts.cpp:183
msgid "Enable/disable Access Ke&y activation with Ctrl key"
msgstr "कंट्रोल कुंजी के साथ पहुंच कुंजी ल सक्छम/अक्छम करव (&y)"

#: htmlopts.cpp:184
msgid ""
"Pressing the Ctrl key when viewing webpages activates KDE's Access Keys. "
"Unchecking this box will disable this accessibility feature. (Konqueror "
"needs to be restarted for changes to take effect.)"
msgstr ""

#: htmlopts.cpp:195
msgid "Und&erline links:"
msgstr "संकली रेखांकित करव: (&e)"

#: htmlopts.cpp:199
msgctxt "underline"
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "सक्छम"

#: htmlopts.cpp:200
msgctxt "underline"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "अक्छम"

#: htmlopts.cpp:201
msgid "Only on Hover"
msgstr "सिरिफ जब मंडराही"

#: htmlopts.cpp:205
msgid ""
"<html>Controls how Konqueror handles underlining hyperlinks:<br /"
"><ul><li><b>Enabled</b>: Always underline links</li><li><b>Disabled</b>: "
"Never underline links</li><li><b>Only on Hover</b>: Underline when the mouse "
"is moved over the link</li></ul><br /><i>Note: The site's CSS definitions "
"can override this value.</i></html>"
msgstr ""

#: htmlopts.cpp:215
msgid "S&mooth scrolling:"
msgstr "बिनरुके स्क्रोलिंग: (&m)"

#: htmlopts.cpp:219
msgid "When Efficient"
msgstr "जब कुसल होही"

#: htmlopts.cpp:220
msgctxt "smooth scrolling"
msgid "Always"
msgstr "हमेसा"

#: htmlopts.cpp:221
msgctxt "soft scrolling"
msgid "Never"
msgstr "कभू नइ"

#: htmlopts.cpp:225
msgid ""
"<html>Determines whether Konqueror should use smooth steps to scroll HTML "
"pages, or whole steps:<br /><ul><li><b>Always</b>: Always use smooth steps "
"when scrolling.</li><li><b>Never</b>: Never use smooth scrolling, scroll "
"with whole steps instead.</li><li><b>When Efficient</b>: Only use smooth "
"scrolling on pages where it can be achieved with moderate usage of system "
"resources.</li></ul></html>"
msgstr ""

#: javaopts.cpp:79
msgid "Enable Ja&va globally"
msgstr "जावा सक्छम करव (विस्वव्यापी)  (&v)"

#: javaopts.cpp:95
msgid "Java Runtime Settings"
msgstr "जावा रन-टाइम सेटिंग"

#: javaopts.cpp:100
msgid "&Use security manager"
msgstr "सुरक्छा प्रबंधक उपयोग करव (&U)"

#: javaopts.cpp:104
msgid "Use &KIO"
msgstr "के-आईओ उपयोग करव (&K)"

#: javaopts.cpp:108
#| msgid "Shu&tdown applet server when inactive"
msgid "Shu&tdown applet server when inactive for more than"
msgstr "जब अतका देर से अक्रिय होही तहां ऐपलेट सर्वर ल बंद करव (&t)"

#: javaopts.cpp:115
msgid " sec"
msgstr " सेक."

#: javaopts.cpp:121
msgid "&Path to Java executable, or 'java':"
msgstr "जावा एक्जीक्यूटेबल या 'जावा' के रस्ता: (&P)"

#: javaopts.cpp:125
msgid "Additional Java a&rguments:"
msgstr "अउ जावा आर्गुमेंट्सः (&r)"

#: javaopts.cpp:130
msgid ""
"Enables the execution of scripts written in Java that can be contained in "
"HTML pages. Note that, as with any browser, enabling active contents can be "
"a security problem."
msgstr ""

#: javaopts.cpp:133
msgid ""
"<p>This box contains the domains and hosts you have set a specific Java "
"policy for. This policy will be used instead of the default policy for "
"enabling or disabling Java applets on pages sent by these domains or hosts.</"
