#: jspolicies.cpp:169 jspolicies.cpp:223 jspolicies.cpp:260 jspolicies.cpp:297
#: jspolicies.cpp:337
msgid "Allow"
msgstr "स्वीकारव"

#: jspolicies.cpp:170
msgid "Accept all popup window requests."
msgstr "सब्बो पापअप विंडो निवेदन स्वीकारव."

#: jspolicies.cpp:175
msgid "Ask"
msgstr "पूछव"

#: jspolicies.cpp:176
msgid "Prompt every time a popup window is requested."
msgstr "जब पापअप विंडो बर निवेदिन करे गे हो, हर बार पूछव"

#: jspolicies.cpp:181
msgid "Deny"
msgstr "अस्वीकारव"

#: jspolicies.cpp:182
msgid "Reject all popup window requests."
msgstr "सब्बो पापअप विंडो निवेदन ल नकारव."

#: jspolicies.cpp:187
msgid "Smart"
msgstr "स्मार्ट"

#: jspolicies.cpp:188
msgid ""
"Accept popup window requests only when links are activated through an "
"explicit mouse click or keyboard operation."
msgstr ""
"पाप अप विंडो तभू स्वीकारव जब संकली ल विसिस्ट मुसुवा किलिक या कुंजीपट आपरेसन से "
"सक्रिय करे जाथे."

#: jspolicies.cpp:195
msgid ""
"If you disable this, Konqueror will stop interpreting the <i>window.open()</"
"i> JavaScript command. This is useful if you regularly visit sites that make "
"extensive use of this command to pop up ad banners.<br /><br /><b>Note:</b> "
"Disabling this option might also break certain sites that require <i>window."
"open()</i> for proper operation. Use this feature carefully."
msgstr ""

#: jspolicies.cpp:209
msgid "Resize window:"
msgstr "विंडो ल नवा-आकार देव:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:224
msgid "Allow scripts to change the window size."
msgstr "विंडो आकार मं बदलाव बर स्क्रिप्ट ल अनुमति देव."

#: jspolicies.cpp:229 jspolicies.cpp:266 jspolicies.cpp:303 jspolicies.cpp:343
msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "अनदेखा करव"

#: jspolicies.cpp:230
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the window size. The web page will "
"<i>think</i> it changed the size but the actual window is not affected."
msgstr ""
"विंडो आकार बदले वाले स्क्रिप्ट ल अनदेखा करव. वेब पेज यह<i>सोचही</i> कि ए ह आकार ल "
"बदल दे हे फेर सही विंडो आकार अप्रभावित रहिही."

#: jspolicies.cpp:237
msgid ""
"Some websites change the window size on their own by using <i>window.resizeBy"
"()</i> or <i>window.resizeTo()</i>. This option specifies the treatment of "
"such attempts."
msgstr ""

#: jspolicies.cpp:246
msgid "Move window:"
msgstr "विंडो खिसकाव:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:261
msgid "Allow scripts to change the window position."
msgstr "विंडो स्थिति मं बदलाव बर स्क्रिप्ट ल अनुमति देव."

#: jspolicies.cpp:267
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the window position. The web page will "
"<i>think</i> it moved the window but the actual position is not affected."
msgstr ""
"विंडो जगह बदले वाले स्क्रिप्ट ल अनदेखा करव. वेब पेज यह<i>सोचही</i> कि ए ह विंडो ल "
"खिसका दे हे फेर सही जगह अप्रभावित रहिही."

#: jspolicies.cpp:274
msgid ""
"Some websites change the window position on their own by using <i>window."
"moveBy()</i> or <i>window.moveTo()</i>. This option specifies the treatment "
"of such attempts."
msgstr ""

#: jspolicies.cpp:283
msgid "Focus window:"
msgstr "फोकस विंडोः"

#: jspolicies.cpp:298
msgid "Allow scripts to focus the window."
msgstr "विंडो फोकस करे बर स्क्रिप्ट ल अनुमति देव."

#: jspolicies.cpp:304
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to focus the window. The web page will <i>think</"
"i> it brought the focus to the window but the actual focus will remain "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"विंडो फोकस करे वाले स्क्रिप्ट ल अनदेखा करव. वेब पेज यह<i>सोचही</i> कि ए ह विंडो मं "
"फोकस कर दे हे फेर सही फोकस अप्रभावित रहिही."

#: jspolicies.cpp:312
msgid ""
"Some websites set the focus to their browser window on their own by using "
"<i>window.focus()</i>. This usually leads to the window being moved to the "
"front interrupting whatever action the user was dedicated to at that time. "
"This option specifies the treatment of such attempts."
msgstr ""

#: jspolicies.cpp:323
msgid "Modify status bar text:"
msgstr "स्थिति पट्टी पाठ बदलव:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:338
msgid "Allow scripts to change the text of the status bar."
msgstr "स्थिति पट्टी पाठ बदले बर स्क्रिप्ट ल अनुमति देव."

#: jspolicies.cpp:344
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the status bar text. The web page will "
"<i>think</i> it changed the text but the actual text will remain unchanged."
msgstr ""
"स्थिति पट्टी पाठ बदले वाले स्क्रिप्ट ल अनदेखा करव. वेब पेज यह<i>सोचही</i> कि ए ह पाठ "
"ल बदल दे हे फेर सही पाठ अप्रभावित रहिही."

#: jspolicies.cpp:352
msgid ""
"Some websites change the status bar text by setting <i>window.status</i> or "
"<i>window.defaultStatus</i>, thus sometimes preventing displaying the real "
"URLs of hyperlinks. This option specifies the treatment of such attempts."
msgstr ""

